Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 06:37:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 33/34] target/dadao: introduce cfx timer scaffolding (KL-133a)

Introduces cfx_hart/cfx_timer register state, timer masks, counter0 one-shot/periodic mechanics, common TIMER generation, and single-instruction async boundaries.

This patch preserves the initial pre-execute/TB-boundary accounting stage for audit history. The immediately following KL-133a follow-up replaces it with the frozen successful-retirement model, fault exclusion, terminal-path retirement, private-to-common level re-latching, and precise shutdown handling; the two patches are one acceptance unit.
---
